# Diagnostics overlay — the FAILURE-MODE catalog the auto-extractors can't see.
# Code-extracted reads/writes show STRUCTURE, not the silent decision-points where bugs hide
# (wrong value, shows 0, stuck, missing, duplicate, reverted). Each `diag` node = one failure mode:
#   class · symptom · the decision-point (file:line or doc) · what it depends on · how it silently fails ·
#   the LIVE diagnostic that proves which branch fired · the fix.
# Query: `kg why <symptom|request|processor|table>`.  Extend: append a node+edges line, then build.sh.
# Classes: config_resolution | silent_catch | race_condition | state_gate | feature_flag | null_default | ordering
{"t":"node","id":"diag:config_resolution.family","kind":"diag","class":"config_resolution","label":"Price-setup charge resolution (family) — charge silently 0 when scheme mapping inactive","symptom":"a charge/fee amount shows 0 or blank on a quote/preview/simulation screen","role":"charge fee amount shows zero blank not displaying missing price setup resolution product_scheme transaction_catalogue is_deleted config_resolution","src":"novopay-platform-accounting-v2/src/main/java/in/novopay/accounting/productscheme/daoservice/ProductSchemeTransactionCataloguePriceSetupRepository.java:43","mechanism":"findPriceSetupCodeByProductSchemeIdAndCatalogueTypeAndSubType(schemeId,<TYPE>,<SUBTYPE>) resolves the charge code via an ACTIVE product_scheme__transaction_catalogue__price_setup mapping","depends":"product_scheme__transaction_catalogue__price_setup (is_deleted=false) -> transaction_catalogue(type,sub_type) -> price_setup.code; then loan_due_details.charge_code must == resolved code","fails_to":"resolver returns NULL when scheme has NO active mapping (all is_deleted=true / not mapped / wrong type|sub_type) -> charge computed as 0.00, no error","diagnostic":"SELECT is_deleted,count(*) FROM mfi_accounting.product_scheme__transaction_catalogue__price_setup ps JOIN mfi_accounting.transaction_catalogue tc ON tc.id=ps.transaction_catalogue_id WHERE ps.product_scheme_id=<SCHEME> AND tc.type='<TYPE>' GROUP BY is_deleted;  -- need exactly 1 active","runbook":"claude/runbooks/charge-amount-shows-zero.md","reference":"claude/accounting/charge-price-setup-resolution.md"}
{"t":"node","id":"diag:config_resolution.cbc_fee_foreclosure","kind":"diag","class":"config_resolution","label":"CBC Fee on foreclosure quote shows 0 when scheme CBC mapping inactive","symptom":"CBC / bounce charge shows 0.00 on foreclosure screen despite seeded bounce/SI_Fee data","role":"CBC fee bounce charge SI_Fee foreclosure quote simulation shows zero blank not displaying missing presentation_bounce_charge price setup config_resolution","src":"novopay-platform-accounting-v2/src/main/java/in/novopay/accounting/loan/foreclosure/processor/FetchLoanForeclosureSimulationDetailsProcessor.java:221","mechanism":"findPriceSetupCode(...,'CBC','DEFAULT') -> fetchCBCDetails() [line 373]; CBC code in tenant = 'SI_Fee' (price_setup id 32 'CBC Charges')","depends":"loan_due_details WHERE charge_code=<resolved CBC code> AND due_amount>paid+waived AND due_date<=foreclosure_date AND is_deleted=false","fails_to":"cbc_amount HARD-SET to \"0.00\" in fetchCBCDetails else-branch when cbcPriceSetupCode is null. NOT read from presentation_bounce_charge_details (SI bounce ledger, batch-only). Proven QA3 2026-06-11 loan 6008846130/scheme 1: 26 CBC->SI_Fee mappings all is_deleted=true -> 0 active -> 0.00","diagnostic":"SELECT is_deleted,count(*) FROM mfi_accounting.product_scheme__transaction_catalogue__price_setup WHERE product_scheme_id=<SCHEME> AND transaction_catalogue_id=(SELECT id FROM mfi_accounting.transaction_catalogue WHERE type='CBC' AND sub_type='DEFAULT' AND is_deleted=false) GROUP BY is_deleted;","fix":"Activate exactly ONE CBC->SI_Fee mapping for the scheme (is_deleted=false), mirroring a working scheme; the loan_due_details FEE/SI_Fee row then surfaces as CBC Fee","runbook":"claude/runbooks/charge-amount-shows-zero.md","reference":"claude/accounting/charge-price-setup-resolution.md"}
{"t":"node","id":"diag:config_resolution.foreclosure_fee","kind":"diag","class":"config_resolution","label":"Foreclosure Fee on foreclosure quote — transactional charge resolution","symptom":"Foreclosure Fee shows 0 on the foreclosure quote","role":"foreclosure fee charge amount shows zero blank foreclosure quote simulation price setup FORCLSR_CHRG config_resolution","src":"novopay-platform-accounting-v2/src/main/java/in/novopay/accounting/loan/foreclosure/processor/FetchLoanForeclosureSimulationDetailsProcessor.java:204","mechanism":"fetchTransactionalCharges(ec, date, futurePrincipal, 'foreclosure_fee', FORCLSR_CHRG, loanAccountId)","depends":"product_scheme__transaction_catalogue__price_setup(active) -> transaction_catalogue(type=foreclosure) -> price_setup(rate/flat+tax_group); futurePrincipal>0","fails_to":"0 when no active foreclosure-charge mapping on scheme, or futurePrincipal=0; tax added only when charge_inclusive_of_tax=false","diagnostic":"SELECT ps.price_setup_code,tc.type,ps.is_deleted FROM mfi_accounting.product_scheme__transaction_catalogue__price_setup ps JOIN mfi_accounting.transaction_catalogue tc ON tc.id=ps.transaction_catalogue_id WHERE ps.product_scheme_id=<SCHEME> AND tc.type ILIKE '%FORCL%';","runbook":"claude/runbooks/charge-amount-shows-zero.md","reference":"claude/accounting/charge-price-setup-resolution.md"}
{"t":"node","id":"diag:race_condition.cas_autoflush_revert","kind":"diag","class":"race_condition","label":"Disbursement/loan status reverts after CAS (Hibernate auto-flush stomp)","symptom":"disbursement_status / loan_status drifts back to an older value after a successful transition; 'stuck' or reverted state","role":"disbursement_status loan_status reverts stomp overwrite CAS auto-flush stale updated_on race condition stuck drifted in-memory setter REQUIRES_NEW","src":"claude/rules/multi-path-state-persistence-safety.md + skill state-machine-safety + memory feedback_no_inmem_mutation_after_cas","mechanism":"After ChildClmtStateMachineService/LoanAccountStateMachineService.transition or patchJsonFields (the CAS), any setter on the same entity is re-flushed by the OUTER disburseLoan Hibernate context with a STALE updated_on, reverting the CAS","depends":"loan_account / loan_account_events_queue (multi-writer rows; AbstractBaseEntity has no @PreUpdate)","fails_to":"CAS wins in DB momentarily, then outer-tx commit auto-flushes the in-memory mutation and silently reverts it — looks like a lost update / race","diagnostic":"SELECT id,disbursement_status,loan_status,updated_on,updated_by FROM mfi_accounting.loan_account WHERE id=<id>;  -- compare updated_on vs the CAS log; also loan_account_events_queue data->>'disbursement_status'","fix":"CAS is the SOLE writer — never call setters on a CAS'd entity afterward (post 4c339282f, 2026-05-07)","runbook":"claude/runbooks/disbursement-stuck.md","reference":"claude/engines/disbursement-engine.md"}
{"t":"node","id":"diag:silent_catch.task_id_orphan","kind":"diag","class":"silent_catch","label":"Foreclosure/task stuck with task_id NULL (swallow-and-return on pre-step API failure)","symptom":"loan stuck in FORECLOSURE_FREEZE with part_prepayment/prepayment task_id NULL; task never created","role":"task_id null orphan FORECLOSURE_FREEZE stuck swallow catch return getCustomerDetails getUserDetails getBankEmployeeDetails silent_catch maker checker","src":"claude/runbooks/task-id-orphan-data-patch.md (pre-154b500c0 CreateTaskWorkFlowHelpingProcessor)","mechanism":"CreateTaskWorkFlowHelpingProcessor caught a getCustomerDetails/getUserDetails/getBankEmployeeDetails failure and returned WITHOUT creating the task, but status was still moved to FREEZE","depends":"mfi_task.task + loan_account_part_prepayment_details.task_id","fails_to":"no task row, task_id NULL, loan frozen — silent (exception swallowed); fixed 154b500c0 (throws fatal now)","diagnostic":"SELECT loan_status FROM mfi_accounting.loan_account WHERE account_id=<id>;  + SELECT task_id FROM mfi_accounting.loan_account_part_prepayment_details WHERE loan_account_id=<id>;","fix":"On 154b500c0+ the processor throws; existing orphans need the data patch in the runbook","runbook":"claude/runbooks/task-id-orphan-data-patch.md","reference":"claude/flows/foreclosure-and-closure.md"}
