{"t":"node","id":"diag:activation.batch_job_not_registered","kind":"diag","class":"activation","label":"Batch/EOD job coded but never runs — BatchConfigService not wired into a *JobLoader (no batch_job/batch_schedule row)","symptom":"a new batch/EOD job never fires — no log line, no mfi_batch.batch_job or batch_schedule row — even though the Java Reader/Processor/Writer quad, the <Request>, and the api_master row all exist","role":"batch job not running not registered never fires coded but never runs no batch_job row not in batch_schedule buildJobForTenant JobLoader loader activation wiring bootstrap EOD job missing placeholder api_master 13022 dpiAccrualCalculation dpiBilling why doesnt my job run","src":"novopay-platform-accounting-v2/src/main/java/in/novopay/accounting/batchnew/common/LoanSystemDailyJobLoader.java:60","mechanism":"a batch job registers ONLY if a *JobLoader (invoked by Loader.initJobs @PostConstruct) calls <Job>BatchConfigService.buildJobForTenant() -> setUpJobAdvanceV2 -> registerSingleton(jobName) + createBatchJob() which auto-seeds batch_job/batch_group/batch_schedule(cron)","depends":"BatchConfigService wired into a *JobLoader (e.g. LoanSystemDailyJobLoader); BatchJobPlaceholderConfig stub bean; api_master row (HTTP routing only); <Request> BATCH branch; batch service restarted so AutoScheduler arms the new batch_schedule","fails_to":"if buildJobForTenant() is never invoked (config service in no loader) -> no batch_job/batch_schedule row -> batch-service AutoScheduler arms nothing -> job NEVER fires, silently. api_master/orchestration/Java existing does NOT imply registration. Missing placeholder bean instead -> service fails to BOOT (loud).","diagnostic":"grep -rn '<Job>BatchConfigService' novopay-platform-accounting-v2/.../batchnew/common/*JobLoader.java (must appear); SELECT name,status FROM <tenant>_mfi_batch.batch_job WHERE name='<jobName>'; -- no row => never registered => check loader wiring + placeholder + api_master FIRST","runbook":"claude/runbooks/eod-failed.md","reference":"claude/platform/system-activation-and-wiring.md"}
