{"t":"node","id":"diag:display.child_cg_gl_vs_parent_named","kind":"diag","class":"null_default","label":"Child force-bill / postTransaction GL shown with parent names (CG strip)","symptom":"child settlement GL shown as REG EMI-JLGDL- BI / INT ACC NOT DUE-JLGDL-AIR instead of CG13336 / CG13578","role":"child CG gl_code force-bill BILLING transaction_partition_details is_child_gl_code CHILD_GL_CODE_PREFIX parent named GL rename strip CG general_ledger.name TDPQA-72 display","src":"trustt-platform-accounting/src/main/java/in/novopay/accounting/transaction/processor/ExecuteTransactionRulesProcessor.java:391-393","mechanism":"is_child_account=true prefixes gl_code with ChildGeneralLedgerEntity.CHILD_GL_CODE_PREFIX=CG and sets is_child_gl_code; parent keeps bare general_ledger codes/names","depends":"transaction_partition_details.gl_code as stored; do not strip CG or join general_ledger.name for child legs","fails_to":"agents/handoffs invent parent GL names by stripping CG — wrong proof; harness assert_force_bill_gl_shape + jira-fix-adf child_gl_renamed_to_parent_name catch","diagnostic":"SELECT tpd.gl_code,tpd.is_child_gl_code,tpd.cr_dr_indicator,tpd.amount FROM mfi_accounting.transaction_partition_details tpd JOIN mfi_accounting.transaction_master tm ON tm.id=tpd.transaction_id WHERE tm.reference_number='<fb_ref>' ORDER BY tpd.cr_dr_indicator; -- child must be CG*","fix":"Quote tpd.gl_code as stored; parent may use named GLs; child must show CG*; memory feedback_child_cg_gl_vs_parent_named.md","runbook":"cursor-bundle/brain/runbooks/sdcp-10199-group-parent-last-child-dfc.md","reference":"cursor-bundle/brain/accounting/08-gl-posting-engine.md"}
